# హయప్రచార_రగడ · hayapracara_ragada — prosodic grammar (jati, 2 lines, repeatable, 8–12 aksharas per line)
# generated from meter_rules.yaml by indic_meter_dawg; do not edit by hand
#
# One grammar, three forms: (1) hierarchical, for reading; (2) right-linear, the same language flattened;
# (3) strict, one symbol per production = the prosodic automaton. All three generate exactly the same poems.
#
# Terminals: U = guru (2 matras), I = laghu (1 matra), ⏎ = line separator.
# Nonterminals: Poem, Unit, Line_<slot>, gana classes (Surya, Indra, Kanda, M4 …), ganas (భ, ర, …).
#   Kanda−జ  = the class minus జ (a constraint removed it)   Kanda=జ|నల = only జ or నల allowed
#   Kanda$U  = only members ending in a guru                   X⟨U⟩ = inside the branch where every line starts with U
#   L2.G3    = line 2, about to read gana 3 (forms 2 and 3)
#   A_UUI_2  = inside alternative UUI of A, 2 symbols already read (form 3 only)

# ===== 1. Hierarchical: Poem → lines → gana classes → ganas → symbols
# poem
Poem → Unit | Unit ⏎ Poem                        # one unit
Unit → Line ⏎ Line                               # 2 lines

# lines
Line → M3 M3 M3 M3                               # slot all: 4 ganas

# gana classes
M3 → వ | హ | న                                   # class m3

# ganas → symbols
వ → I U                                          # va, 3 matras
హ → U I                                          # ha, 3 matras
న → I I I                                        # na, 3 matras

# ===== 2. Right-linear (A → wB | w) over {U, I, ⏎}: the hierarchy flattened
Poem → IU L1.G2 | UI L1.G2 | III L1.G2
L1.G1 → IU L1.G2 | UI L1.G2 | III L1.G2
L1.G2 → IU L1.G3 | UI L1.G3 | III L1.G3
L1.G3 → IU L1.G4 | UI L1.G4 | III L1.G4
L1.G4 → IU⏎ L2.G1 | UI⏎ L2.G1 | III⏎ L2.G1
L2.G1 → IU L2.G2 | UI L2.G2 | III L2.G2
L2.G2 → IU L2.G3 | UI L2.G3 | III L2.G3
L2.G3 → IU L2.G4 | UI L2.G4 | III L2.G4
L2.G4 → IU | IU⏎ L1.G1 | UI | UI⏎ L1.G1 | III | III⏎ L1.G1

# ===== 3. Strict (A → aB | a): 76 productions, 56 states;
# minimized prosodic automaton: 26 states. Every production is commented.
Poem → I Poem_IU_1                # వ va: symbol 1/2 read, 1 to go
Poem_IU_1 → U L1.G2               # వ va: symbol 2/2, complete → L1.G2
L1.G1 → I L1.G1_IU_1              # వ va: symbol 1/2 read, 1 to go
L1.G1_IU_1 → U L1.G2              # వ va: symbol 2/2, complete → L1.G2
Poem → U Poem_UI_1                # హ ha: symbol 1/2 read, 1 to go
Poem_UI_1 → I L1.G2               # హ ha: symbol 2/2, complete → L1.G2
L1.G1 → U L1.G1_UI_1              # హ ha: symbol 1/2 read, 1 to go
L1.G1_UI_1 → I L1.G2              # హ ha: symbol 2/2, complete → L1.G2
Poem → I Poem_III_1               # న na: symbol 1/3 read, 2 to go
Poem_III_1 → I Poem_III_2         # న na: symbol 2/3 read, 1 to go
Poem_III_2 → I L1.G2              # న na: symbol 3/3, complete → L1.G2
L1.G1 → I L1.G1_III_1             # న na: symbol 1/3 read, 2 to go
L1.G1_III_1 → I L1.G1_III_2       # న na: symbol 2/3 read, 1 to go
L1.G1_III_2 → I L1.G2             # న na: symbol 3/3, complete → L1.G2
L1.G2 → I L1.G2_IU_1              # వ va: symbol 1/2 read, 1 to go
L1.G2_IU_1 → U L1.G3              # వ va: symbol 2/2, complete → L1.G3
L1.G2 → U L1.G2_UI_1              # హ ha: symbol 1/2 read, 1 to go
L1.G2_UI_1 → I L1.G3              # హ ha: symbol 2/2, complete → L1.G3
L1.G2 → I L1.G2_III_1             # న na: symbol 1/3 read, 2 to go
L1.G2_III_1 → I L1.G2_III_2       # న na: symbol 2/3 read, 1 to go
L1.G2_III_2 → I L1.G3             # న na: symbol 3/3, complete → L1.G3
L1.G3 → I L1.G3_IU_1              # వ va: symbol 1/2 read, 1 to go
L1.G3_IU_1 → U L1.G4              # వ va: symbol 2/2, complete → L1.G4
L1.G3 → U L1.G3_UI_1              # హ ha: symbol 1/2 read, 1 to go
L1.G3_UI_1 → I L1.G4              # హ ha: symbol 2/2, complete → L1.G4
L1.G3 → I L1.G3_III_1             # న na: symbol 1/3 read, 2 to go
L1.G3_III_1 → I L1.G3_III_2       # న na: symbol 2/3 read, 1 to go
L1.G3_III_2 → I L1.G4             # న na: symbol 3/3, complete → L1.G4
L1.G4 → I L1.G4_IUNL_1            # వ va: symbol 1/3 read, 2 to go
L1.G4_IUNL_1 → U L1.G4_IUNL_2     # వ va: symbol 2/3 read, 1 to go
L1.G4_IUNL_2 → ⏎ L2.G1            # వ va: symbol 3/3, complete → L2.G1
L1.G4 → U L1.G4_UINL_1            # హ ha: symbol 1/3 read, 2 to go
L1.G4_UINL_1 → I L1.G4_UINL_2     # హ ha: symbol 2/3 read, 1 to go
L1.G4_UINL_2 → ⏎ L2.G1            # హ ha: symbol 3/3, complete → L2.G1
L1.G4 → I L1.G4_IIINL_1           # న na: symbol 1/4 read, 3 to go
L1.G4_IIINL_1 → I L1.G4_IIINL_2   # న na: symbol 2/4 read, 2 to go
L1.G4_IIINL_2 → I L1.G4_IIINL_3   # న na: symbol 3/4 read, 1 to go
L1.G4_IIINL_3 → ⏎ L2.G1           # న na: symbol 4/4, complete → L2.G1
L2.G1 → I L2.G1_IU_1              # వ va: symbol 1/2 read, 1 to go
L2.G1_IU_1 → U L2.G2              # వ va: symbol 2/2, complete → L2.G2
L2.G1 → U L2.G1_UI_1              # హ ha: symbol 1/2 read, 1 to go
L2.G1_UI_1 → I L2.G2              # హ ha: symbol 2/2, complete → L2.G2
L2.G1 → I L2.G1_III_1             # న na: symbol 1/3 read, 2 to go
L2.G1_III_1 → I L2.G1_III_2       # న na: symbol 2/3 read, 1 to go
L2.G1_III_2 → I L2.G2             # న na: symbol 3/3, complete → L2.G2
L2.G2 → I L2.G2_IU_1              # వ va: symbol 1/2 read, 1 to go
L2.G2_IU_1 → U L2.G3              # వ va: symbol 2/2, complete → L2.G3
L2.G2 → U L2.G2_UI_1              # హ ha: symbol 1/2 read, 1 to go
L2.G2_UI_1 → I L2.G3              # హ ha: symbol 2/2, complete → L2.G3
L2.G2 → I L2.G2_III_1             # న na: symbol 1/3 read, 2 to go
L2.G2_III_1 → I L2.G2_III_2       # న na: symbol 2/3 read, 1 to go
L2.G2_III_2 → I L2.G3             # న na: symbol 3/3, complete → L2.G3
L2.G3 → I L2.G3_IU_1              # వ va: symbol 1/2 read, 1 to go
L2.G3_IU_1 → U L2.G4              # వ va: symbol 2/2, complete → L2.G4
L2.G3 → U L2.G3_UI_1              # హ ha: symbol 1/2 read, 1 to go
L2.G3_UI_1 → I L2.G4              # హ ha: symbol 2/2, complete → L2.G4
L2.G3 → I L2.G3_III_1             # న na: symbol 1/3 read, 2 to go
L2.G3_III_1 → I L2.G3_III_2       # న na: symbol 2/3 read, 1 to go
L2.G3_III_2 → I L2.G4             # న na: symbol 3/3, complete → L2.G4
L2.G4 → I L2.G4_IU_1              # వ va: symbol 1/2 read, 1 to go
L2.G4_IU_1 → U                    # వ va: symbol 2/2, complete, line ends
L2.G4 → I L2.G4_IUNL_1            # వ va: symbol 1/3 read, 2 to go
L2.G4_IUNL_1 → U L2.G4_IUNL_2     # వ va: symbol 2/3 read, 1 to go
L2.G4_IUNL_2 → ⏎ L1.G1            # వ va: symbol 3/3, complete → L1.G1
L2.G4 → U L2.G4_UI_1              # హ ha: symbol 1/2 read, 1 to go
L2.G4_UI_1 → I                    # హ ha: symbol 2/2, complete, line ends
L2.G4 → U L2.G4_UINL_1            # హ ha: symbol 1/3 read, 2 to go
L2.G4_UINL_1 → I L2.G4_UINL_2     # హ ha: symbol 2/3 read, 1 to go
L2.G4_UINL_2 → ⏎ L1.G1            # హ ha: symbol 3/3, complete → L1.G1
L2.G4 → I L2.G4_III_1             # న na: symbol 1/3 read, 2 to go
L2.G4_III_1 → I L2.G4_III_2       # న na: symbol 2/3 read, 1 to go
L2.G4_III_2 → I                   # న na: symbol 3/3, complete, line ends
L2.G4 → I L2.G4_IIINL_1           # న na: symbol 1/4 read, 3 to go
L2.G4_IIINL_1 → I L2.G4_IIINL_2   # న na: symbol 2/4 read, 2 to go
L2.G4_IIINL_2 → I L2.G4_IIINL_3   # న na: symbol 3/4 read, 1 to go
L2.G4_IIINL_3 → ⏎ L1.G1           # న na: symbol 4/4, complete → L1.G1
